${SCRIPT_NAME} <command> [subcommand] [arguments…]

${_CLR_BOLD}CONFIGURATION${_CLR_RESET}
File: ${CONFIG_FILE}
OWNER       GitHub username
ROOT        Working root directory (most commands)
OUT         Output directory (repos dump)
