	--tsan-options "opts"   Extra TSAN_OPTIONS (only for tsan)
	--verbose               Show full configure + compile output

	Execution priority (per repository):
	1. --executable  → run the binary directly
	2. --test        → ctest -R REGEX
	3. (none)        → ctest (all tests)

